# case-scaleup-1111 r2 later rows for pinky32 (coordinator 2026-11-11: duplicate exports accepted when they enable a new join); generated by scripts/case-scaleup-1111-r2/later.py; 15 rows, est 3.6 h on pinky (planning only, R10); tier cinf, mem 80; each join has needok on the export it waits for (placed or running on pinky32); re-exports precede their joins.
# heap -Xmx8g for JMC exports; at most one JMC export at a time on a pinky or volta, three on a brain
